+# Enterprise Full Provision & Validate Runbook
+
+This runbook orchestrates the full provisioning and validation for Level‑4 readiness.
+
+Phases:
+1) Provisioning (Terraform)
+ - Run terraform in terraform/prod to create KMS and Rekor. Capture cosign_kms_arn and rekor endpoint.
+ - Use scripts/set_github_secrets.sh to populate CI secrets COSIGN_KEY and REKOR_SERVER.
+
+2) Platform Deploy
+ - Deploy Vault HA via Helm using ops/vault/helm/vault-ha-values.yaml
+ - Deploy Strimzi operator, Bitnami Redis, MLflow (helm values in helm/*)
+ - Deploy approver & qpu services, run migrations (k8s/postgres/*)
+ - Deploy Rekor service (terraform output)
+
+3) Validation
+ - Run .github/workflows/full_provision_validate.yml or run ops/validation/readiness_check.py locally
+ - Run TRTBake CI job (.github/workflows/trt_bake_sign_verify.yml)
+ - Execute pentest (ops/pentest/advanced_pentest.sh) and schedule external pen test.
+ - Execute extended 7+ day canary per ops/canary/extended_canary_runbook.md
+
+4) DR Drill
+ - Run ops/dr/run_dr_drill.sh <new-kms-arn>
+
+5) Compliance evidence
+ - Run ops/compliance/evidence_packager_enhanced.py
+ - Upload evidence bundle to compliance trackers
+
+Sign-offs:
+ - Security, SRE, Finance, Compliance must sign acceptance before flipping AUTONOMOUS namespaces.
+
